  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A regional program for Africa on human rights education. Partners are HR Centers, universities, HR-NGOs and Government Institutions responsible for respect for HR.The aim is to strengthen knowledge about the international conventions on HR among all these organsiations as a means to deepen democracy and in a sense &quot;the rule of law&quot;.</narrative>
